.SS iq driver ls
List the backend drivers iq can dispatch to
.PP
\fBUsage:\fR iq driver ls
.PP
List the backend drivers iq can dispatch to. Each row shows the driver's stable name (as `iq ls` reports it), a description, the URI schemes that select it, the backend server versions the bundled client library supports, and a link to its upstream documentation. \-v appends the file driver's readable dump formats (which auto\-detect, which need ?format=). \-j/\-\-json or \-y/\-\-yaml emit machine\-readable output.
